Package: marestrata
Type: Package
Title: Subset MareStrata Ocean Climate Layers over HTTPS
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jorge", "Assis", email = "jorgemfa@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Query a catalog of MareStrata ocean climate layers and open the
    matching tiled GeoTIFFs with terra over HTTPS. A longitude and latitude
    extent is read as a window, so only that region is transferred.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://biodiversitydatascience.com
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: terra
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
